# Kimss Java SDK

Follow docs/KIMSS_ONBOARDING.md when integrating Kimss.

- OpenAI OkHttp client: baseUrl https://api.kimss.ai/v1, apiKey kimss_...
- Native: KimssClient.builder().baseUrl("https://api.kimss.ai").apiKey(...).build(); agents().run(id, message). No agents().get().
- Native auth is X-Kimss-Key only.
- Do not rewrite Anthropic/Azure official clients to Kimss inbound URLs.
- Kill switch: agent_disabled. Never "zero-trust". Keys are kimss_...
